      "body": "I'd like to take a stab at this. The third `parse_known_args` call at line 1536 passes `self.known_args_namespace` as the namespace, which already has the `-W` values from the second parse. Since `-W` uses `action=\"append\"`, it gets duplicated. Planning to fix it by using `copy.copy(self.option)` instead, same as the first two calls.",
